{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_31", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_31.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Don't talk nonsense!", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "They all say it is only imagination, you know.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, let it go at that!", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Let them have their own way about it!", "para": 0, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Haven't the ignorant, narrow-minded curs reviled me as an enemy of the people?\u2014and haven't they been ready to tear the clothes off my back too?", "para": 0, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "And broken all your windows to pieces!", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "And then there is my duty to my family.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "I must talk it over with Katherine; she is great on those things.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "That is right; be guided by a reasonable woman's advice.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (advancing towards him).", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "To think you could do such a preposterous thing!", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "Risking Katherine's money in this way, and putting me in such a horribly painful dilemma!", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "When I look at you, I think I see the devil himself\u2014.", "para": 4, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Then I had better go.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "But I must have an answer from you before two o'clock\u2014yes or no. If it is no, the shares go to a charity, and that this very day.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "And what does Katherine get?", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Not a halfpenny.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "(The door leading to the hall opens, and HOVSTAD and ASLAKSEN make their appearance.)", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Look at those two!", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (staring at them).", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "What the devil!\u2014have YOU actually the face to come into my house?", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Certainly.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "We have something to say to you, you see.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Morten Kiil (in a whisper).", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes or no\u2014before two o'clock.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (glancing at HOVSTAD).", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Aha!", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "(MORTEN KIIL goes out.)", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, what do you want with me?", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Be brief.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "I can quite understand that you are annoyed with us for our attitude at the meeting yesterday.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Attitude, do you call it?", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, it was a charming attitude!", "para": 15, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "I call it weak, womanish\u2014damnably shameful!", "para": 15, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Call it what you like, we could not do otherwise.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "You DARED not do otherwise\u2014isn't that it?", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, if you like to put it that way.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "But why did you not let us have word of it beforehand?\u2014just a hint to Mr. Hovstad or to me?", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "A hint?", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Of what?", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "Of what was behind it all.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't understand you in the least\u2014", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (with a confidential nod).", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh yes, you do, Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "It is no good making a mystery of it any longer.", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (looking first at one of them and then at the other).", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "What the devil do you both mean?", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "May I ask if your father-in-law is not going round the town buying up all the shares in the Baths?", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, he has been buying Baths shares today; but\u2014", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "It would have been more prudent to get someone else to do it\u2014someone less nearly related to you.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "And you should not have let your name appear in the affair.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "There was no need for anyone to know that the attack on the Baths came from you.", "para": 29, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "You ought to have consulted me, Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 29, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (looks in front of him; then a light seems to dawn on him and he says in amazement.)", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Are such things conceivable?", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Are such things possible?", "para": 30, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen (with a smile).", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Evidently they are.", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "But it is better to use a little finesse, you know.", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "And it is much better to have several persons in a thing of that sort; because the responsibility of each individual is lessened, when there are others with him.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (composedly).", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Come to the point, gentlemen.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you want?", "para": 33, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Perhaps Mr. Hovstad had better\u2014", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "No, you tell him, Aslaksen.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, the fact is that, now we know the bearings of the whole affair, we think we might venture to put the \"People's Messenger\" at your disposal.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you dare do that now?", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "What about public opinion?", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Are you not afraid of a storm breaking upon our heads?", "para": 37, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "We will try to weather it.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "And you must be ready to go off quickly on a new tack, Doctor.", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "As soon as your invective has done its work\u2014", "para": 39, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you mean, as soon as my father-in-law and I have got hold of the shares at a low figure?", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Your reasons for wishing to get the control of the Baths are mainly scientific, I take it.", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Of course; it was for scientific reasons that I persuaded the old \"Badger\" to stand in with me in the matter.", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "So we will tinker at the conduit-pipes a little, and dig up a little bit of the shore, and it shan't cost the town a sixpence.", "para": 42, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "That will be all right\u2014eh?", "para": 42, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "I think so\u2014if you have the \"People's Messenger\" behind you.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "Aslaksen.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "The Press is a power in a free community.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "Doctor.", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": []}]}